  "verseCount": 22,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "1",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "RUT 1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "1",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwathi ensukwini zabahluleli kwaba khona indlala elizweni. Umuntu othile waseBetlehema koJuda wasuka wayahlala elizweni laseMowabi, yena lomkakhe lamakhe amabili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ibizo lakhe lalinguElimeleki, elomkakhe linguNawomi, amabizo amadodana akhe amabili ayengoMaheloni loKiliyoni; babengabaseEfratha eBetlehema koJuda. Baya elizweni laseMowabi, bahlala khona.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.1.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UElimeleki umkaNawomi wafa, kwasala yena lamadodana akhe womabili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amadodana akhe athatha abafazi bamaMowabi, ibizo lomunye lalinguOrpa, elomunye linguRuthe. Bahlala khona kwaphosa kwaba yiminyaka elitshumi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bobabili oMaheloni loKiliyoni bafa, walahlekelwa uNawomi ngamadodana akhe womabili layindoda yakhe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wasesuka eMowabi labomalokazana bakhe, ngoba wayesezwile eselizweni laseMowabi ukuthi iNkosi ibakhumbule abantu bayo, yabanika ukudla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngakhoke wasesuka lapho ayekhona labomalokazana bakhe bobabili, bahamba laye ukuba abuyele elizweni lakoJuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UNawomi wasesithi kubomalokazana bakhe bobabili: Buyelani lonke ezindlini zabonyoko; iNkosi iliphathe kuhle njengoba labaphatha kuhle abafileyo kanye lami; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "iNkosi ilinike ukuba libuye lende futhi, lihlale kuhle labomkenu abatsha. Wasebanga, bona basebedazuluka bekhala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bathi kuye: Atshi, sizahamba lawe kwabakini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kodwa uNawomi wathi: Buyelani, bantwana bami, lizahambelani lami na? Kambe ngiselawo yini amanye amadodana esiswini sami ukuba abe ngabomkenu na? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Buyelani, bantwana bami; hambani, ngoba mina sengikhulile kakhulu ukuba ngibuye ngibe lendoda. Loba ngingathi ngilethemba lokuzuza umntwana, uba ngingenda ngabona lobubusuku ngizale amadodana, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "belingawalindela yini aze akhule na? Belingahlala lingendi na? Atshi, bantwana bami, ngoba kubuhlungu kakhulu kimi ngenxa yenu ukuba isandla seNkosi silwe lami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basebedazuluka bekhala futhi. UOrpa wamanga uninazala, wabuyela kwabakibo; kodwa uRuthe wabambelela kuye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.1.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UNawomi wathi: Khangela, umnakwenu usebuyele kwabakibo lakubonkulunkulu bakhe; mlandele usowenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kodwa uRuthe wathi: Ungangincengi ukuba ngikutshiye lokuba ngiyekele ukukulandela; ngoba lapho uya khona, ngizakuya khona lami, lalapho uhlala khona, lami ngizahlala khona. Abantu bakini bazakuba ngabakithi, loNkulunkulu wakho abe nguNkulunkulu wami; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "lapho uzafela khona, lami ngizafela khona, ngingcwatshelwe lapho. INkosi ingihlanekele ngokwengezelelweyo uba ngingehlukaniswa lawe yilutho ngaphandle kokufa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwathi uNawomi esebonile ukuthi uRuthe uzimisele ukuhamba laye wasemyekela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.1.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 1:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basebehamba bobabili baze bafika eBetlehema. Sebefikile khona kwayaluzela umuzi wonke ngenxa yabo. Abesifazana bathi: Lo unguye uNawomi na? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.1.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 1:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yena wathi kibo: Lingangibizi ngokuthi nginguNawomi, kodwa lingibize ngokuthi nginguMara; ngoba uSomandla ungiphethe ngobuhlungu obukhulu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.1.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.1.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 1:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngasuka lapha ngigcwele, iNkosi ingibuyise sengize. Lingibizelani ngokuthi nginguNawomi njengoba iNkosi isingihlanekele, loSomandla esengehlisele okubi na? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.1.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.1.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 1:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wabuya ngokunjalo uNawomi kanye loRuthe waseMowabi umalokazana wakhe, bevela elizweni laseMowabi. Bafika eBetlehema ekuqaliseni kokuvunwa kwamabele.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.1.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.1.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
